# Coding in C 
We will learn how to code in C programme 
First thing we will learn is pointers : 
%s  strings or alphabet have
%d	signed decimal integer	int a = 10;
%i	signed integer (decimal, octal, hex input allowed in scanf)	scanf("%i", &a);
%u	unsigned decimal integer	unsigned int x;
%o	unsigned octal	prints in base‑8
%x	unsigned hex (lowercase)	0x1a
%X	unsigned hex (uppercase)	0x1A



